    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the most ridiculous racing championship on four paws!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>hot-seat party racer</strong>, one player streams the game while up to six capybara pilots <strong>chime in, strategize, and cause absolute mayhem</strong>. Pick from bizarre vehicles like a <strong>UFO, burger car, or even a boat on wheels</strong>, and race your way to glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>How It Works:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One player streams, the rest play along! </strong>Or just play as envisioned, one couch, several friends. No need to stream if you're all in the same space, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your capybara and vehicle</strong>\u2014each one as ridiculous as the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set the race pace</strong>\u2014fast and furious or slow and strategic? It\u2019s up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between races, repair your ride in the garage</strong>\u2014if you can afford it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place bets</strong> on race outcomes\u2014predict correctly and double your gold!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use game-changing cards</strong> during races\u2014boost, sabotage, or launch cheese attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn gold &amp; points</strong>\u2014gold for repairs and betting, points for championship dominance!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for chaotic fun with friends!</strong> Whether you\u2019re sabotaging rivals, placing risky bets, or just laughing at a capybara in a flying saucer, every race is unpredictable!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the most ridiculous racing championship on four paws!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>hot-seat party racer</strong>, one player streams the game while up to six capybara pilots <strong>chime in, strategize, and cause absolute mayhem</strong>. Pick from bizarre vehicles like a <strong>UFO, burger car, or even a boat on wheels</strong>, and race your way to glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>How It Works:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One player streams, the rest play along! </strong>Or just play as envisioned, one couch, several friends. No need to stream if you're all in the same space, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your capybara and vehicle</strong>\u2014each one as ridiculous as the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set the race pace</strong>\u2014fast and furious or slow and strategic? It\u2019s up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between races, repair your ride in the garage</strong>\u2014if you can afford it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place bets</strong> on race outcomes\u2014predict correctly and double your gold!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use game-changing cards</strong> during races\u2014boost, sabotage, or launch cheese attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn gold &amp; points</strong>\u2014gold for repairs and betting, points for championship dominance!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for chaotic fun with friends!</strong> Whether you\u2019re sabotaging rivals, placing risky bets, or just laughing at a capybara in a flying saucer, every race is unpredictable!</p>",
    "short_description": "Race, bet, and cause capybara-fueled chaos! One player streams, up to six join in, picking wacky vehicles, choosing race paces, and playing cards to boost, sabotage, or repair. Win gold, place bets, and chase championship glory in this wild party racing sim!",
